{"id": "t044-059", "text": "zofia's partner Dafydd running the berlin marathon next sun. she's flying out the friday b4 to watch. his 1st marathon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "zofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dafydd", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "berlin marathon", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next sun", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the friday b4", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t044-060", "text": "kofi's mum Mrs Okafor having her other hip done in the spring. kofi says she's dreading it after last time. ask him the date next time I see him", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kofi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Okafor", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her other hip done", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "kofi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him the date", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time I see him", "anchor": "a1"}]}
